{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25822","headline":"新楼诗二十首 重台莲 · 李绅","name":"新楼诗二十首 重台莲","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"绿荷舒卷凉风晓，红萼开萦紫菂重。\n游女汉臯争笑脸，二妃湘浦竝愁容。\n自含秋露贞姿结，不竞春妖冶态穠。\n终恐玉京仙子识，却将归种碧池峰。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李绅","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25822.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25822","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}